{1 Quickstart}

Add the driver to your dune project with [neodriver] and [neodriver_eio] (and
[Eio_main] to run [Eio_main.run]). A minimal program that connects and runs a
query:

{v
open Neodriver

let () =
  Eio_main.run (fun env ->
    let net = Eio.Stdenv.net env in
    let clock = Eio.Stdenv.mono_clock env in
    Eio.Switch.run (fun sw ->
      let session =
        match
          Driver.connect ~uri:"bolt://localhost:7687"
            ~auth:(Conn.basic_auth ~credentials:"your_password" ())
            net clock sw
        with
        | Ok session -> session
        | Error error -> failwith (Errors.to_string error)
      in
      match Session.run session ~query:"RETURN 1 AS n" ~parameters:[] with
      | Ok result -> (
          match Neo4jResult.values result with
          | Ok [ [ Values.Int n ] ] -> Printf.printf "n = %Ld\n%!" n
          | _ -> ())
      | Error error -> failwith (Errors.to_string error)))
v}

{1 Packages}

The four opam packages, in dependency order:

- [neodriver] — this aggregator: [open Neodriver] covers the whole API.
- [neodriver_packstream] — PackStream binary serialization.
- [neodriver_core] — transport-agnostic core (errors, config, temporal
  values, hydration).
- [neodriver_eio] — the Eio (OCaml 5) backend.

{1 API reference}

The per-package module documentation (each root module re-exports its API):

- {{:Neodriver/index.html }Neodriver} — the aggregator (see also the Modules list below).
- {{:../neodriver_core/Neodriver_core/index.html }Neodriver_core} — Errors, Config,
  Addressing, Deadline, Temporal, Values, Hydration, Capabilities.
- {{:../neodriver_eio/Neodriver_eio/index.html }Neodriver_eio} — Driver, Conn, Session,
  Tx, Neo4jResult, Summary, Transport, Bolt, State, Handshake.
- {{:../neodriver_packstream/Neodriver_packstream/index.html }Neodriver_packstream} —
  Packstream.

{1 Modules}

The root {!module:Neodriver} re-exports the whole API:

- connection and transport: {!module:Neodriver.Conn}, {!module:Neodriver.Transport},
  {!module:Neodriver.Bolt}, {!module:Neodriver.State};
- sessions and transactions: {!module:Neodriver.Session}, {!module:Neodriver.Tx};
- results: {!module:Neodriver.Neo4jResult}, {!module:Neodriver.Summary};
- the entry point: {!module:Neodriver.Driver};
- core types: {!module:Neodriver.Packstream}, {!module:Neodriver.Errors},
  {!module:Neodriver.Config}, {!module:Neodriver.Addressing},
  {!module:Neodriver.Temporal}, {!module:Neodriver.Values},
  {!module:Neodriver.Hydration}, {!module:Neodriver.Capabilities}.
